{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24171","headline":"同诸客嘲雪中马上妓 · 白居易","name":"同诸客嘲雪中马上妓","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"珊瑚鞭嚲马踟蹰，引手低蛾索一盂。\n腰爲逆风成弱柳，面因冲冷作凝酥。\n银箆稳篸乌罗帽，花襜宜乘吒拨驹。\n雪里君看何所似，王昭君妹写真图。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"白居易","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24171.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24171","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言律诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}